# Removed contextual-editing scaffold (@tinacms/astro, tina-island, demo
# page) -- Cowork's sandbox couldn't delete these files outright, only move
# them, so they're parked here instead. Safe to delete for real from
# Explorer/Terminal; ignored in the meantime so a forgotten delete doesn't
# get committed.
_tina-scaffold-removed/

# Tina admin is local-editing-only (August 2026, no Tina Cloud account) --
# the static /admin bundle `tinacms build` produces has no backend to talk to
# once deployed, so it's not tracked. `npm run build:admin` regenerates it
# locally if you ever want to eyeball it; nothing consumes the output.
public/admin/

# Same Cowork-sandbox delete limitation as above -- the previously-committed
# public/admin/ was moved here instead of deleted. Safe to delete for real
# from Finder/Terminal.
_tina-admin-removed/